[sliver] These are the explicit 0.9 mm lip tips, 1.2 mm engagement faces and 1.5 mm wing ends of the anchor cap's snap interface (`_anchor_cap_interface`), which the tee cap shares with its half pipe sized to the tee anchor's journal; they are not remnants of intersecting solids. Release force and endurance on this article are unmeasured.
alternatives: Thicker lip tips or wings change the catch/window engagement and the spring motion. Removing these faces removes the capture.
